<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electroglas started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electroglas started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co said on Thursday it started coverage of Electroglas Inc with a market perform rating, a source at the firm said.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Its shares were up 1-3/8 at 22-1/2.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
